sing tension throughout your body and promoting deep relaxation and ultimate relief.', 270000, 'IDR', 3), ('Body Sculpt', 'Wooden Massage', 'Awaken your body with this deeply stimulating wooden therapy, designed to drain, sculpt and revitalize.', null, null, 0), ('Sculpt', 'Full Body Massage with Wooden Tools', 'This full-body experience uses the traditional wooden tools of madérothérapie to stimulate circulation, break down fat deposits and firm the skin. Perfect for reducing water retention and boosting lymphatic flow.', 700000, 'IDR', 0), ('Focus Upper Body', 'Arms, Back, and Stomach Massage', 'A targeted session focusing on the arms, back and stomach area. Ideal for those looking to tone and relieve muscular tension in the upper body.', 400000, 'IDR', 0), ('Focus Lower Body', 'Legs, Glutes, and Hips Massage', 'This lower-body treatment emphasizes legs, glutes and hips to drain toxins, reduce bloating and tone the skin.', 400000, 'IDR', 0), ('Multi-session Package', 'Wooden Massage 10 Sessions', 'Boost your results with regular sessions.', 6500, 'IDR', 0)) as i(sec, name, descr, price, cur, pos) on i.sec = secs.name;

