000, 'IDR', 1), ('HANDMADE PASTA', 'CHICKEN PESTO PASTA', 'Basil pesto pasta served with grilled chicken', 99000, 'IDR', 2), ('HANDMADE PASTA', 'TRUFFLE STEAK PASTA', '150 gr beef tenderloin steak served with linguini in truffle butter cream, gravy & chive', 249000, 'IDR', 3), ('MAINS', 'LE BARRA CAPPARIS', 'Pan-fried barramundi fillet served with spiced country wedges and lemon mustard caper cream sauce', 145000, 'IDR', 0), ('MAINS', 'SALMON DIANE', 'Salmon steak, roasted potato & classic velvety butter cream brandy sauce', 199000, 'IDR', 1), ('MAINS', 'FRENCH BEEF BOURGUIGNON', 'Slow braised beef Bourguignon in aromatic red wine beef broth served with amandine potatoes & vegetables', 175000, 'IDR', 2), ('MAINS', 'DUCK LEG CONFIT', 'Tender duck leg slow-cooked in its own fat, served with truffle mashed potatoes and seasonal greens', 169000, 'IDR', 3), ('SWEETS', 'VANILLA CRÈME BRÛLÉE', 'A rich vanilla custard topped with a caramelized sugar crust, silky smooth with a delicate crunch', 69000, 'IDR', 0), ('SWEETS', 'PROFITEROLE', 'Cream puffs with vanilla ice cream, served with warm chocolate', 65000, 'IDR', 1), ('SWEETS', 'CHOCOLATE LAVA', 'Decadent warm chocolate cake oozing with gooey molten centre', 75000, 'IDR', 2), ('SWEETS', 'THE KISSED', 'Strawberry cheesecake served with fruit coulis', 65000, 'IDR', 3), ('SIGNATURE COCKTAILS', 'KISS FROM PARIS', 'A timeless journey through the heart of Paris. Born from the poetry of French cafés, capturing the elegance of a bygone era in one intoxicating sip.', 145000, 'IDR', 0), ('SIGNATURE COCKTAILS', 'THE ALCHEMIST', 'Born from the whispers of forgotten laboratories, this is a sip of transformation. A cocktail where the mystery of ancient Europe meets the serene magic of Ubud in perfect, light-filled harmony.', 145000, 'IDR', 1), ('SIGNATURE COCKTAILS', 'SMOKE VERDIER', 'Inspired by Balinese ceremonial fires, Smoke Verdier blends smoky cherry wood and fragrant herbs, echoing the essence of incense, flame, and ritual in every intoxicating sip.', 145000, 'IDR', 2), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'GALANG KANGIN', 'Inspired by the eastern sun and ancestral spirits, Galang Kangin is a tribute to new beginnings. Rooted in arak and lifted by brightness, it captures the quiet power of dawn in a glass of light and balance.', 120000, 'IDR', 0), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'NAGA RAJA', 'A tribute to the sacred dragon, guardian of balance and abundance. Drawing from ancient island mythology, Naga Raja is a vibrant, commanding blend where tradition and imagination rise as one.', 120000, 'IDR', 1), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'SAMUDERA', 'An echo of Bali’s sacred shores, where the ocean is the source of life. Samudera reflects the depth of vibrant waters, carrying the gentle motion of waves and the breath of tropical winds in every sip.', 120000, 'IDR', 2), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'WENARA WANA', 'Inspired by the dense forests of Ubud and the legends of the monkey king. Wenara Wana is a tribute to the forest monarch, capturing playful energy, curiosity, and wild freedom in every vibrant sip.', 120000, 'IDR', 3), ('FORGOTTEN ARAK', 'UBUD RITUAL', 'Inspired by unspoken moments shared in silence and incense smoke. Ubud Ritual is private, balanced, and quietly dangerous. Crafted for those who know to look beyond the surface of the sacred.', 120000, 'IDR', 4), ('ZERO PROOF', 'DAWN AT UBUD', 'A crisp, golden awakening that captures the first light of Ubud’s morning dew.', 60000, 'IDR', 0), ('ZERO PROOF', 'SILENT OFFERING', 'A graceful tribute to the quiet moments of gratitude found in island rituals.', 60000, 'IDR', 1), ('ZERO PROOF', 'TEMPLE MIST', 'Cooling and ethereal, like the sacred breeze drifting through ancient stone walls.', 60000, 'IDR', 2), ('ZERO PROOF', 'SACRED MISCHIEF', 'A playful dance of island flavors, celebrating the spirited energy of the forest.', 60000, 'IDR', 3), ('ZERO PROOF', 'BERRY SPARK', 'Effervescent and joyful. A vibrant celebration of summer’s sweetest berries.', 60000, 'IDR', 4)) as i(sec, name, descr, price, cur, pos) on i.sec = secs.name;

