nied by Garlic or Herb Bread.', 95000, 'IDR', 4), ('Snacks & Light Delight', 'Garlic or Herb Bread', 'Simple and Easy Light Bites for Your Enjoyment', 55000, 'IDR', 0), ('Snacks & Light Delight', 'French Fries', 'Golden Brown Crispy French Fries, Accompanied by a Zesty Chili Sauce and Tomato Ketchup', 60000, 'IDR', 1), ('Snacks & Light Delight', 'Spinach and Mushroom Bruschetta', 'A Delightful Fusion of Spinach, Mushroom, and Mozzarella Cheese, Gracefully Presented on Top of Toasted Baguette Bread.', 75000, 'IDR', 2), ('Snacks & Light Delight', 'Chicken Bruschetta Spectacle', 'A Symphony of Tomato, Chicken, and Mozzarella Cheese on Top of Crispy Baguette Bread.', 95000, 'IDR', 3), ('Snacks & Light Delight', 'Fish and Chips Extravaganza', 'Indulge in a Classic All-Time Favorite of Crispy Fried Dory Fish and Golden French Fries Served Alongside Tangy Tartar Sauce.', 120000, 'IDR', 4), ('Snacks & Light Delight', 'Vegetarian Spring Rolls Fiesta', 'Indulge in a Burst of Flavours with Our Vegetable Spring Rolls, Perfectly Paired with Sweet Thai Style Chili Sauce.', 80000, 'IDR', 5), ('Something Fun for The Kids', 'Hot Dog Adventure', 'Treat Your Kids to an All-Time American Classic Hot Dog, Featuring Pan-Fried Beef Sausage and Crisp Vegetables, Nestled in a Soft Hot Dog Bun. Served with Golden French Fries.', 80000, 'IDR', 0), ('Something Fun for The Kids', 'Mini Pasta Passion', 'Let Your Little Ones Indulge in an All-Time Favorite of Mini-Pasta with Choice of Bolognese or Carbonara Sauce, Accompanied by Irresistible Garlic Bread.', 93000, 'IDR', 1), ('Something Fun for The Kids', 'Mini Pizza Party', 'Ignite Their Taste Buds with Our Mini Pizza, Featuring Chicken Sausages, Onions, Paprika, Tomatoes, and Delicious Mozzarella Cheese.', 80000, 'IDR', 2), ('Side Dish', 'Steamed Vegetables', null, 45000, 'IDR', 0), ('Side Dish', 'Mixed Garden Greens Salad', null, 50000, 'IDR', 1), ('Side Dish', 'Steamed Rice', null, 40000, 'IDR', 2), ('Side Dish', 'Crispy Sweet Onion Rings', n